(ns skein.studio.icons
  "Skein Studio's icons (Skein's M3.9, D-115): SVG path data in a 24-unit box, stroked 2
wide with round ends, as skein-ui's vector-image draws them. The paths are Xeon Studio's,
which are Feather's icons (MIT, Copyright (c) 2013-2023 Cole Bemis), some adapted and a few
its own; see PROVENANCE.md and LICENSES/feather.txt."
  (:require [skein.ui :as ui]))

